hub.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/2060600894","html_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/1423#issuecomment-2060600894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/1423","id":2060600894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAU0OSs560kY-","user":{"login":"lfhy","id":17682328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjgyMzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17682328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy","html_url":"https://github.com/lfhy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lfhy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-04-17T07:45:48Z","updated_at":"2024-04-17T07:45:48Z","body":"> 2024 年了，现在可以共享挂载了吗？\r\n\r\n视图是一致的吧，mount服务会订阅filer变更，当触发元数据更新的时候也会更新mount本地的元数据缓存","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/2060600894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/2381284388","html_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/1423#issuecomment-2381284388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/1423","id":2381284388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAU0OSs6N74Qk","user":{"login":"shamork","id":714295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDI5NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/714295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork","html_url":"https://github.com/shamork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-29T09:35:33Z","updated_at":"2024-09-29T09:58:29Z","body":"现在同类filer（都是本地的，或都是共享的）可以同步元数据，但不是强一致性的，因此可以启动多个filer，但是只能用于滚动重启的场景([Async Replication to another Filer](https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/wiki/Async-Replication-to-another-Filer) [Deprecated])。\r\n\r\n最新的文档参见：https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/wiki/Filer-Store-Replication\r\n\r\n我现在在测试用 weed filer.meta.backup 把leveldb的filer store 异步同步到 mongodb的filer store，然后在一个合适的时机，停掉leveldb filer，启动mongodb filer，然后再启动多个mongodb filer，此时多个filer看起来是高可用的","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/2381284388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]